                            Professional software engineering team project developed over multiple sprints using agile methodologies. TerraTracker is a GPS route tracking and sharing platform that allows users to record, visualize, and share their outdoor activities. The project demonstrates end-to-end software development lifecycle from requirements gathering through deployment, emphasizing collaborative development practices and professional software engineering principles.
